# Build context for the judge image (Dockerfile) and the compose api/worker services.
# The Dockerfile copies an explicit list; this keeps secrets and bulky local state out of the context.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets
**/.secrets
*.pem
*.key
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
logs
data/local
data/generated
data/out
data/_truth
*.duckdb
submission/media
